From 7d547a8aa6f905a8b45d92f53a32125451eb85b8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Owen Shepherd <owen@owen.cafe>
Date: Thu, 23 May 2024 13:55:34 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat: Add Haskell demangler

This adds a Haskell (GHC) demangler, as per:
https://gitlab.haskell.org/ghc/ghc/-/wikis/commentary/compiler/symbol-names

Haskell mangles symbol names because of its support for custom
operators, and because haskell identifiers can contain unicode.
